{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.QMomentum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.QMomentum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.List.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.GeomSum","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.writhe_mirror","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.writhe_mirror","kind":"theorem","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L219-L239","doc":"Mirror reversal negates the writhe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.writhe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.writhe","kind":"def","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L206-L209","doc":"The writhe of a braid word (sum of crossing signs). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum_classical_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum_classical_limit","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L136-L202","doc":"At q = 1, q-momentum equals the writhe (sum of signs). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.qMomentum","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L40-L46","doc":"The q-momentum of a braid, computed from its crossing signs.\nEach positive crossing contributes +1, each negative contributes -1,\nweighted by q-deformation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.q_param","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L37-L37","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.R_q","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-momentum.lean#L34-L36","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}